message: "If you use this software or its reported results, please cite this repository and record the commit used."
type: software
title: "Optimizer-aware residual auditing"
authors:
  - family-names: Legotin
    given-names: Artem
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arlegotin/optimizer-aware-residual-auditing"
